[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 38582.39, "timestamp": "10:43:02", "text": "歌詞是“哦，我甚至都蹲不下去”。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 38584.95, "timestamp": "10:43:04", "text": "已經把它禁用了。哦，不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 38588.07, "timestamp": "10:43:08", "text": "。沒關係。我可以，我可以帶著一個"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 38597.19, "timestamp": "10:43:17", "text": "盲注推注8。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 38632.95, "timestamp": "10:43:52", "text": "哎呀，我已經落後了。是的，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 38638.31, "timestamp": "10:43:58", "text": "的東西大概有2000個。"}]